<title>ARGENTINA: Mexico's ICA to buy half of Argentina's CPC-source.</title>
<headline>Mexico's ICA to buy half of Argentina's CPC-source.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican building firm ICA will buy 50 percent of Argentine builder CPC, which is wholly owned by Comercial del Plata, for an undisclosed amount, a source close to the deal said Monday.</p>
<p>The source did not provide further details, while officials at Comercial del Plata declined comment.</p>
